---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | ZPMLabber" description="About ZPMLabber, the maintainer behind open-source SDKs, packages, and experiments.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="prompt mb-4 text-sm">cat about.md</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-white md:text-6xl">Maintainer notes from the lab.</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
      <div class="terminal-pane rounded-lg">
        <div class="terminal-topbar">
          <span class="terminal-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
          <span>avatar.png</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-200/70">profile</span>
        </div>
        <div class="relative p-4">
          <img
            class="aspect-square w-full rounded-md border border-blue-400/20 object-cover"
            src="/zpmlabber.png"
            alt="ZPMLabber profile artwork"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-sm text-cyan-100">role=software-god</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-pane rounded-lg p-6">
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-invert prose-zpm max-w-none">
      <p>ZPMLabber is a personal creator and maintainer identity for open-source developer tools, SDKs, packages, and focused engineering experiments.</p>
      <p>The work centers on practical developer experience: API clients, Laravel and PHP packages, frontend integrations, documentation tooling, internationalization audits, and legacy refactoring workflows.</p>
      <h2>Focus areas</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Community SDKs and external service wrappers</li>
        <li>Reusable PHP, Laravel, JavaScript, and TypeScript packages</li>
        <li>Documentation systems and package discovery</li>
        <li>Build-in-public engineering notes</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Links</h2>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/zpmlabber">ZPMLabber on GitHub</a> · <a href="https://github.com/community-sdks">Community SDKs</a> · <a href="https://github.com/zpm-packages">ZPM Packages</a></p>
    </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
